            "type": "game",
            "name": "Chronicle of Innsmouth",
            "steam_appid": 420180,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Curse of Chaos – the third chapter of Chronicle of Innsmouth</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420180/extras/35cad317f5cf32d8d2ec9e6b6a540bea.avif?t=1793789984\" width=700 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The free demo is available now on Steam! Try it and add the game to your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for “Chronicle of Innsmouth: Curse of Chaos” in the Steam Store.</p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on ‘The Shadow over Innsmouth’ by master of <strong>horror H.P. Lovecraft</strong>, and inspired by the classic gameplay of the early 90s’ Lucasarts adventures, Chronicle of Innsmouth sets you on a path to discover the secrets of the cursed town of Innsmouth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins with a trip through New England. At the Newburyport station, you hear for the first time about the fishing town of Innsmouth – once a rich and thriving port, now a decadent forsaken place, surrounded by rumors about disappearances, hidden cults and all kinds of unspeakable horrors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420180/extras/75d8d180ff9b87fd5a6d4509c00426cc.avif?t=1793789984\" width=600 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moved by sheer curiosity, you decide to investigate the truth behind these odd stories. But Innsmouth and its inhabitants guard their secrets carefully – and the truth might be a burden too heavy for anyone’s sanity. Investigate, gather information and solve enigmas and puzzles to get to the bottom of all the mysteries of Innsmouth – if you dare, for you may find answers you would have preferred not to hear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate, gather info and solve enigmas to unveil the secrets of the cursed town of Innsmouth, a forsaken place surrounded by horrifying rumors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CHRONICLE OF INNSMOUTH SAGA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chronicle of Innsmouth saga spans centuries of cosmic horror:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronicle of Innsmouth</strong> – the first chapter, set in the cursed town of Innsmouth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountains of Madness</strong> – a prequel set 10 years before the first chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curse of Chaos</strong> – the third chapter, set in Oman in 500 AD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter tells a standalone story: start anywhere, or play them all to uncover how the threads connect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHOTOSENSITIVE EPILEPSY WARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very small percentage of people may experience seizures or blackouts when exposed to certain visual effects, such as flashing lights or patterns, even if they have no history of epilepsy. These effects can occur while watching videos or playing games. If you or anyone in your family has a history of seizures or epilepsy, consult a doctor before playing. Stop playing immediately and consult a doctor if you experience dizziness, altered vision, eye or muscle twitching, loss of awareness, disorientation, involuntary movements or convulsions. To reduce risk, play in a well-lit room, sit at a reasonable distance from the screen and take regular breaks.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on ‘The Shadow over Innsmouth’ by master of <strong>horror H.P. Lovecraft</strong>, and inspired by the classic gameplay of the early 90s’ Lucasarts adventures, Chronicle of Innsmouth sets you on a path to discover the secrets of the cursed town of Innsmouth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins with a trip through New England. At the Newburyport station, you hear for the first time about the fishing town of Innsmouth – once a rich and thriving port, now a decadent forsaken place, surrounded by rumors about disappearances, hidden cults and all kinds of unspeakable horrors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420180/extras/75d8d180ff9b87fd5a6d4509c00426cc.avif?t=1793789984\" width=600 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moved by sheer curiosity, you decide to investigate the truth behind these odd stories. But Innsmouth and its inhabitants guard their secrets carefully – and the truth might be a burden too heavy for anyone’s sanity. Investigate, gather information and solve enigmas and puzzles to get to the bottom of all the mysteries of Innsmouth – if you dare, for you may find answers you would have preferred not to hear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate, gather info and solve enigmas to unveil the secrets of the cursed town of Innsmouth, a forsaken place surrounded by horrifying rumors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CHRONICLE OF INNSMOUTH SAGA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chronicle of Innsmouth saga spans centuries of cosmic horror:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronicle of Innsmouth</strong> – the first chapter, set in the cursed town of Innsmouth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountains of Madness</strong> – a prequel set 10 years before the first chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curse of Chaos</strong> – the third chapter, set in Oman in 500 AD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter tells a standalone story: start anywhere, or play them all to uncover how the threads connect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHOTOSENSITIVE EPILEPSY WARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very small percentage of people may experience seizures or blackouts when exposed to certain visual effects, such as flashing lights or patterns, even if they have no history of epilepsy. These effects can occur while watching videos or playing games. If you or anyone in your family has a history of seizures or epilepsy, consult a doctor before playing. Stop playing immediately and consult a doctor if you experience dizziness, altered vision, eye or muscle twitching, loss of awareness, disorientation, involuntary movements or convulsions. To reduce risk, play in a well-lit room, sit at a reasonable distance from the screen and take regular breaks.</p>",
            "short_description": "Chronicle of Innsmouth is a point'n'click adventure inspired by Lucas' retro classics from the 90s and H.P. Lovecraft's works. Investigate, gather info and solve enigmas to unveil the secrets of the cursed town of Innsmouth, a forsaken place surrounded by horrifying rumors.",
