                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A must for people who like point and click adventures. It's very well written and with a reasonable level of difficulty that will attract both new and experienced players of the genre. It starts off like a comical story, but soon transits into a much darker world... The transition is so smooth that you are left vulnerable to the horror element of the story in a very brilliant way! WELL DONE DEVS! This is worth every single penny these people are asking for!",
